": "Cutover", "children": [], "description": "Cutover identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within release, adoption, and closure. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. It appears before training because that next topic assumes this starting point."}, {"id": "299d889a-3c31-45ec-92de-0b1be5461181", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Training", "children": [], "description": "Training identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within release, adoption, and closure. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After cutover, training supplies what is needed to address operations handoff."}, {"id": "48c5306f-9304-4ae5-9f35-4fa208e71484", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Operations handoff", "children": [], "description": "Operations handoff identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within release, adoption, and closure. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After training, operations handoff supplies what is needed to address benefits review."}, {"id": "7d20396e-a1ad-4ab7-be93-c5dfc5e523dc", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Benefits review", "children": [], "description": "Benefits review identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within release, adoption, and closure. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. After operations handoff, benefits review supplies what is needed to address retrospectives."}, {"id": "c89d91ba-b81f-4b74-88b8-06996ac81c2a", "type": "subtopic", "title": "Retrospectives", "children": [], "description": "Retrospectives identifies a specific object, distinction, or relationship within release, adoption, and closure. Learners need to recognize and use it before combining this module's ideas in later work. As the final course topic, retrospectives requires ideas from the complete path to be integra